# Agent-harness scratch worktrees. Ignored here rather than only in .git/info/exclude because that file
# is per-clone: Prettier also reads .gitignore, so one entry keeps both git status and format:check clean
# on every machine. Keep this narrow — .claude/settings.json is tracked and stays formatted.
